<title>JAPAN: Nikkodo shares bid-only in over-the-counter trade.</title>
<headline>Nikkodo shares bid-only in over-the-counter trade.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nikkodo Co Ltd was bid-only on Friday in over-the-counter trade, as hopes that the merger between Bandai Co Ltd and Sega Enterprises Ltd would quicken the firm's restructuring, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0451 GMT the shares were bid-only at 441 yen, after closing at 386 yen on the previous day.</p>
</text>
